ind":"update","title":"KAUNA DEMO update - 2026-10-11","summary":"Small KAUNA demo update released.Release notes:- Added issue report link to main menu- Better UI scaling for big resolutions- bug fix: Barrel smoke effect not showing- bug fix: Game started muted with some players on first launch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T13:34:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938495","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3582660-1845383656389533","game_id":"steam-3582660","kind":"announcement","title":"KAUNA DEMO Released!","summary":"KAUNA DEMOKAUNA Demo is finally released on Steam! Please go and give it a shot. It has been a long time coming, but the game is now ready to be shared.If you've tried the earlier Itch.io versions, this new demo is now running on the Godot 4 engine, which should make the game run a lot smoother and faster. The demo includes the first three levels, E0M1, E1M1 and E1M2, plus the E1M7 vehicle level. These levels give you a pretty good feel for the game.Wishlist KAUNA and keep an eye for the future ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T16:40:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389533","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3582660-1825727806721379","game_id":"steam-3582660","kind":"update","title":"KAUNA development update #2","summary":"Hello!It has been a while since last development update. KAUNA has been progressing steadily.Here is a brief update on things I have been creating lately! New Level - Frozen TormentMost of the time lately has gone in work with new level: Frozen Torment. It is icy level with \"floor is lava\" -elements. New enemy (check next paragraph) is lurking in deep snow and player must find ways to not step in it.Frozen Torment is the biggest level yet in KAUNA.New Enemy - Hell ClawHell Claw is primarily livi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-03T19:45:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806721379","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3582660-1811138915527487","game_id":"steam-3582660","kind":"update","title":"KAUNA development update #1","summary":"Hello! Development of KAUNA is progressing well, and I’d like to share some highlights from the past few months.This is the first devlog‑type post, and I hope it gives you insight into how KAUNA evolves.A big thanks to everyone who has wishlisted the game—your support means the world to me!That said, here are some of the features I want to share:CarThe game will feature a fully drivable car and driving levels where you can run over hordes of enemies. You get a short ride at the beginning of the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-22T17:07:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811138915527487","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3582660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3582660":"2026-10-26T10:39:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3582660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:42Z"},"5254550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]